WEBVTT

00:15:28.425 --> 00:15:31.469
Dakle, to je predivan novi horizont,

00:15:31.469 --> 00:15:35.219
to je predivna stvar za otkrivanje za mlade

00:15:35.219 --> 00:15:37.699
i za strastvene stare, kao što sam ja.

00:15:37.699 --> 00:15:39.747
Stoga krenimo na to!

00:15:39.747 --> 00:15:51.247
(Pljesak)